PostgreSQL can abort the application transaction with `40P01`. Local `deadlock_timeout` is 1 second, so the 
migrationâ€™s 5-second `lock_timeout` does not guarantee that the migration becomes the victim. [PostgreSQL locking 
documentation](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/explicit-locking.html)

