while waiting for that user; migration holds the users-table lock while waiting for join; Presence subsequently 
requests its users UPDATE lock.

   **Smallest fix:** acquire both opening lock statements with `NOWAIT`, and retry the entire migration transaction 
after contention. Do not merely swap the messaging tables: application paths use both orders. Add held read/apply and 
Presence/join/apply regressions. [PostgreSQL `LOCK`](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/15/sql-lock.html)

