ual-office/supabase/migrations/20261007184118_conversation_membership_integrity.sql:118), 
[test:1041](E:/projects/virtual-office/__tests__/messaging-db/conversation-membership-integrity.test.ts:1041).

   The header says hosted builds keep creating conversations, while the exact e27dd10 test expects `403/42501`. 
Recording that inherited failure is useful evidence, but it does not establish successful creation compatibility.

