**Handling Supabase telemetry fallback**
**Executing read-only SQL safely**
codex
The new locks cover both r2 deadlock scenarios, including a user row held with `FOR UPDATE`. The backfill references 
only users and conversations. I’m checking the remaining DDL and trigger dependencies; the Supabase CLI hit a 
read-only sandbox error, so I’ll use a local read-only PostgreSQL connection if available.
