**Verdict: approve — no High or Medium findings remain.**

| r2 finding | Disposition |
|---|---|
| Medium 1: migration/application deadlocks | Resolved. Both opening locks use `NOWAIT`; users `EXCLUSIVE` also 
conflicts with the `ROW SHARE` lock held by `SELECT … FOR UPDATE`. Failed acquisition aborts before schema or data 
changes. |
| Low 2: hosted creation compatibility claim | Header corrected. It accurately identifies e27dd10’s inherited 
distinct-ID `403/42501` failure. The specific T21 exception still needs recording in TRACK/state; D8 covers 
